        {
          "id": "9bf49a28-2645-332a-a764-dab22b8d321f",
          "content": {
            "id": "9bf49a28-2645-332a-a764-dab22b8d321f",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Trick or treat? Halloween candy prices are frightening this year",
            "description": "<p>Even when it's Halloween, the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/why-chocolate-prices-scare-halloween-150131069.html\">scariest thing to consumers </a>continues to be inflation! Hershey (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HSY\">HSY</a>) warned of weak Halloween candy sales due to the rising costs of cocoa (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CC=F\">CC=F</a>).</p>\n<p>Market Catalysts host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> outlines the growing price tags on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/halloween-2025-why-chocolate-prices-are-scary-high-165654865.html\">trick-or-treaters' favorite candies</a> over the past five years.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Even when it's Halloween, the scariest thing to consumers continues to be inflation! Hershey (HSY) warned of weak Halloween candy sales due to the rising costs of cocoa (CC=F). Market Catalysts host Julie Hyman outlines the growing price tags on trick-or-treaters' favorite candies over the past five years. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
